y in faith, repentance, accountability, and the importance of remaining true to the path of Allah. It provides guidance for believers on honesty, commitment, and strengthening their relationship with Allah.", "short_description": "Surah At-Tawbah highlights themes of sincerity in faith, repentance, accountability, and the importance of remaining true to the path of Allah. It provides guidance for believers on honesty, commitment, and strengthening their relationship with Allah."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26615344644756884"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827601_2020523101828072_5100793827575115692_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PvLgnrdEaP0Q7kNvwGBt5yz&_nc_oc=Adrt4BMZBAd6HWviyw_TlulwErqeC-xzYaNIA8b08HxXxK9qXPTHbaw8K0fnCHoDWdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV4vroXfIvfo4aq03CT3jwivMlmpJoculkFbqhOS2Vo2Q&oe=6B0F18CB"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer